OL,3,GNEWSAStrangers walked into woman's
OL,4,ATravelodge room while she was undressed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJade Clarke was undressed and brushing
OL,7,Fher teeth when two strangers walked
OL,8,Finto her hotel room last month.
OL,10,FThe 35-year-old was getting ready for a
OL,11,Fwedding at a Travelodge in Glasgow when
OL,12,Fthe incident happened, leaving her and
OL,13,Fthe accidental intruders "mortified".
OL,15,FIt is the latest in a series of similar
OL,16,Fincidents at the hotel chain, with a
OL,17,Freport finding there were room
OL,18,Fintrusions at almost one in 10
OL,19,FTravelodges this summer.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
