OL,3,GNEWSAStrangers walked into woman's
OL,4,ATravelodge room while she was undressed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelodge apologised and said it had
OL,7,Fconducted an investigation and taken
OL,8,Fsteps to ensure it did not happen
OL,9,Fagain.
